        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Dance Machine Cheater in Japan",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110927305398",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 90d2caad-2bf4-4acb-9a17-19d463a6a619).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47.\r\rI am a child from Japan, I am sending this to you in the hopes you will come to Hokkaido.\r\rI am an expert at the dancing game Doki Doki Pow Pow and have achieved the highest score, this makes me really happy\r\rBut there is a handyman who goes by Onkel Nick, his real name is Eric.\r\rHe rigs the machine to cheat and get the highest score, so he can always get number one\r\rPlease 47 kill this man, he tazed me in argument so maybe electrocute him to death, save Doki Doki Pow Pow 47. Sayonara",
        "GameVersion": "8.18.0.0",
        "IsPublished": true,
